# Holiday chatter (bot_living_holidays, AutonomousHolidays; owner 2026-10-28). Real holidays on the PC's calendar,
# talked about the way players did in 2003. holiday_<name> is set for the days around a holiday, holiday_today on the
# day itself. Openers carry @topic holiday (the ambient starter asks for that topic now and then in the window).
# New writing (see docs/bot-voices).

